Reﬁned Linkage to the RDP/DYT12 Locus on
19q13.2 and Evaluation of GRIK5 as a
Candidate Gene
Christoph Kamm, MD, 1 Joanne Leung, MS, 1
Soni Joseph, BS, 2 William B. Dobyns, MD, 3
Alison Brashear, MD, 4 Xandra O. Breakeﬁeld, PhD, 1
and Laurie J. Ozelius, PhD 2*
1Molecular Neurogenetics Unit, Departments of Neurology
and Radiology and Neuroscience Program, Massachusetts
General Hospital and Harvard Medical School, Boston,
Massachusetts, USA
2Department of Molecular Genetics, Albert Einstein College
of Medicine, Bronx, New York, USA
3Department of Human Genetics, Neurology and Pediatrics,
University of Chicago, Illinois, USA
4Department of Neurology, Indiana University School of
