Distressing Belching and Neuroacanthocytosis
Igor Sibon, MD, * Imad Ghorayeb, MD, PhD,
Pierre Arne´, MD, and Franc¸ois Tison, MD, PhD
Fe´de´ration de Neurosciences Cliniques, Centre Hospitalier
